{"sha": "af9ed6704d0fa270bcd2226ccaea10b75e59397d5b5045c0c5e2b2a5f22d9296", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:mechanical-waves} 章 --- 机械波}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:mechanical-waves:1}", "(a) $v = 320/40 = \\qty{8.0}{m/s}$。(b) 没有观众沿", "环形看台移动：扰动（起立这一动作）在传播，人群本身并不移动。", "(c) $12/1.5 = \\qty{8.0}{m/s}$ --- 一致。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:mechanical-waves:2}", "(a) 横波；(b) 纵波；(c) 纵波；(d) 横波；", "(e) P 波为纵波，S 波为横波。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:mechanical-waves:3}", "(a) $d = 340 \\times 4.0 \\approx \\qty{1.4}{km}$.", "(b) $1500 \\times 4.0 = \\qty{6.0}{km}$。(c) 应取所穿过的", "介质中的传播速度。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:mechanical-waves:4}", "$\\lambda = v/f$：空气中 $340/440 = \\qty{0.77}{m}$，", "水中 $1500/440 = \\qty{3.4}{m}$。频率保持不变（由", "波源决定）；$v$ 与 $\\lambda$ 均发生变化。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:mechanical-waves:5}", "$\\lambda = \\qty{12}{cm}$; $T = \\lambda/v = 0.12/0.30 = \\qty{0.40}{s}$;", "$f = 1/T = \\qty{2.5}{Hz}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:mechanical-waves:6}", "(a) $v = 2.4/0.30 = \\qty{8.0}{m/s}$。(b) 由第一张照片可知，", "波峰还需传播 $\\qty{6.0}{m}$，于是 $t = 6.0/8.0 = \\qty{0.75}{s}$ 后波峰到达该处。", "(c) 绳上的条带先升后降，纯属横向运动，且", "始终停留在 $x = \\qty{5.0}{m}$ 处：绳子本身并不随波迁移。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:mechanical-waves:7}", "(a) 接近速率 \\qty{4.0}{m/s}，间距 \\qty{4.0}{m}：$t = \\qty{1.0}{s}$。", "(b) 叠加：$3.0 + 2.0 = \\qty{5.0}{cm}$。", "(c) $3.0 - 2.0 = \\qty{1.0}{cm}$。(d) 两个完好的脉冲", "穿出，并保持原状继续传播，仿佛它们从未相遇。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:mechanical-waves:8}", "(a) 细的那根：张力相同时，单位长度的质量越小，", "波速越快。(b) 波速增大（张力更大）。(c) 否：", "波速只取决于介质，与脉冲大小无关。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:mechanical-waves:9}", "钢轨中：$1800/5900 \\approx \\qty{0.31}{s}$；空气中：", "$1800/340 \\approx \\qty{5.3}{s}$；时间差 $\\approx \\qty{5.0}{s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:mechanical-waves:10}", "取 $\\lambda = \\qty{24}{cm}$：(a) $2\\lambda$，同相；", "(b) $\\lambda/2$，反相；(c) $\\tfrac32\\lambda$，反相；", "(d) $1.25\\lambda$，两者皆非；(e) $\\lambda/4$，两者皆非。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:mechanical-waves:11}", "$\\lambda_P = 6.0 \\times 2.0 = \\qty{12}{km}$;", "$\\lambda_S = 3.5 \\times 2.0 = \\qty{7.0}{km}$ --- 约为一栋建筑物尺寸的数百倍。", "距离远小于 $\\lambda$ 的各点几乎同相，", "因此整个邻近区域一起运动。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:mechanical-waves:12}", "(a) $T = \\qty{0.50}{s}$, $f = \\qty{2.0}{Hz}$.", "(b) $\\lambda = \\qty{0.75}{m}$.", "(c) $v = \\lambda/T = 0.75/0.50 = \\qty{1.5}{m/s}$.", "(d) 在 $t = T = \\qty{0.50}{s}$ 时。(e) $1.875/0.75 = 2.5$ 个", "波长 $= (2 + \\tfrac12)\\lambda$：反相。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:mechanical-waves:13}", "(a) $T = 80/10 = \\qty{8.0}{s}$, $f = \\qty{0.125}{Hz}$.", "(b) $v = \\lambda/T = 120/8.0 = \\qty{15}{m/s} = \\qty{54}{km/h}$.", "(c) $t = 900/15 = \\qty{60}{s}$。(d) 否：波不传递物质 ---", "锚定的浮标只是上下起伏。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:mechanical-waves:14}", "(a) 以接近速率 \\qty{6.0}{m/s} 相向运动，间距 \\qty{6.0}{m}：$t = \\qty{1.0}{s}$；", "相反的位移相互抵消 --- 绳子此刻呈平直状。", "(b) 否：绳上各点仍在运动（横向速度相加，", "而非抵消）；能量全部为动能。(c) 两个脉冲重新出现，", "并保持形状不变地继续传播。(d) 平直的绳子具有速度，因而具有能量：", "波此刻将能量储存于运动之中，而非形状之中。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:mechanical-waves:15}", "(a) $2\\pi r$：\\qty{3.1}{m} 与 \\qty{50}{m} --- $\\times 16$。", "(b) 单位长度的能量降低 $16$ 倍，因此振幅减小（", "能量随振幅增大而增大）。(c) 平直波前不会变长，", "只剩吸收作用。(d) 介质是主动的：每位观众", "依靠自身肌肉的能量站立，为波补充能量。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g12:mechanical-waves:1}", "\\textbf{1.} P 波沿传播方向压缩：纵波；S 波", "侧向振动：横波。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 速度较快的 P 波处处先到达。", "$t_P = 120/6.0 = \\qty{20}{s}$; $t_S = 120/3.5 \\approx \\qty{34}{s}$.", "", "\\textbf{3.} $\\Delta t = d/v_S - d/v_P = d\\,(1/v_S - 1/v_P)$；对于", "\\qty{120}{km}: $34.3 - 20 \\approx \\qty{14}{s}$.", ""]}